{"authorInventoryRecordKeys":["schema","status","role","date","cwd","authorized_write_root","stage","scope","source","image_usage","inventory_conventions","subfigures","global_unknowns_and_blockers","modern_additions_separate_from_source","contracts_read","execution_evidence","not_executed_or_approved","continuation"]}
{"key":"inventory_conventions","value":{"counts":"rows and columns count cell intervals between the outermost visible ruled lines, not the number of lines. Each grid has 19 vertical lines and therefore 18 columns.","coordinates":"Source-read coordinates only. Origin O is the intersection of the coordinate axes, not the subfigure's corner. Positive x points right and positive y points up.","phase":"xOffset=0 and yOffset=0 relative to each subfigure's own O: the axes lie on grid lines, not at half-cell offsets. Raster crops are not coordinate origins.","units":"One source coordinate unit per grid cell. Printed 1 labels independently establish this in a, b and g; v uses the printed right-hand radius 4 spanning four cells. No physical unit is printed.","pixels":"Grid spacing is visually about 44-47 px and varies with scanning tilt. No exact raster-coordinate measurement, deskew or resampling was performed.","hatching":"Fine oblique strokes run from lower left to upper right. Hatching is region fill, not an extra family of mathematical boundaries.","line_styles":"All identifiable region boundaries, axes, circle circumferences and outer grid frames are solid. No deliberate dashed boundary is visible. Ink gaps, label clearances and scan damage are not dashed boundaries.","point_markers":"No separate labelled or filled point marker is given at any origin, rectangle corner, or circle extremum. Future construction points must not become new visible dots or labels.","frame_semantics":"The rectangular outer frame bounds the displayed lattice. In a its right and bottom edges clip an unbounded shaded portion; they must not become new defining boundaries of the exercise's set.","ids":"a, b, v, g are stable transliterations of the source's four Cyrillic subfigure labels, not modern visible labels.","assertion_status":"IDs below reserve future source requirements. No executable FigureSpec assertion or validation result is claimed."}}
